 {reportIndex:0,candidateId:2,category:"correctness",verdict:"CONFIRMED",file:"hooks/session-start-codex",line:43,summary:"The compaction hook emits bare text, but Codex parses SessionStart hook stdout as JSON; the bootstrap is therefore discarded.",failure_scenario:"After compaction, Codex runs the hook successfully but receives no additional context, so the using-superpowers instructions and CONTEXT_RESTORED guidance are absent and post-compaction workflow drift remains.",evidence:"The pinned diff emits plain text beginning with <EXTREMELY_IMPORTANT> at hooks/session-start-codex:43. Codex CLI 0.147.0 independently rejects non-JSON SessionStart output with “hook returned invalid session start JSON output,” so the compact bootstrap is discarded."},
