 {reportIndex:2,candidateId:4,category:"correctness",verdict:"CONFIRMED",file:"hooks/session-start-codex",line:43,summary:"The Codex SessionStart hook emits plain text instead of the JSON hook result Codex requires.",failure_scenario:"On compaction, Codex parses stdout as SessionStart JSON; the first <EXTREMELY_IMPORTANT> line is invalid JSON, so it reports invalid session-start output and discards the bootstrap. The intended context restoration therefore does not occur.",evidence:"The pinned diff's first compact-output line at hooks/session-start-codex:43 is raw <EXTREMELY_IMPORTANT>, not JSON. The installed Codex hook engine independently reports invalid SessionStart JSON output for such stdout, preventing the intended context restoration."},
